OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FTurning
OL,6,Fdrier and brighter this evening as
OL,7,Fpatchy rain peters out. Clear skies
OL,8,Ffor a time overnight, before further
OL,9,Fcloud and rain pushes in from the west
OL,10,Fin the early hours.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FA cloudy and often wet start
OL,13,Fwith brisk winds. Rain will ease
OL,14,Fthrough the morning, with isolated
OL,15,Fshowers, mainly over high ground and
OL,16,Fsome brighter spells into the
OL,17,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
