OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FLargely cloudy at first on Monday and
OL,7,FTuesday, though mostly dry, and
OL,8,Fbrightening during the day. A chance
OL,9,Fof sunnier weather from Wednesday and
OL,10,Fturning increasingly warm.
